    <Box style={{ width: 470, padding: 30, background: '#241C19', borderRadius: 12, minHeight: 350, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'LXGW WenKai, serif', fontSize: 34, color: '#FDF9F2', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>他们吃过苦，也见过光。<br />没说过什么豪言壮语，<br />却把日子过成了一部历史。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Source Han Sans, sans-serif', fontSize: 15, color: '#C9A96E', letterSpacing: 2 }}>—— 陈守义，1963—</Text>
